<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθέλκω</span></b> , aor.
		inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελκύσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
					<u>in Phdr.</u>
					p.170A.
				</span></i>
			:—<i>draw</i> or <i>pull against,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀλλήλαις</span>
			<i>pull against</i> one another, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				644e
			</span></i>; 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν ψυχήν</span>
			<i>draw</i> it <i>in a contrary direction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				439b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλανθρώπως τινὰς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					30.8
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of <i>resistance</i> of facts <i>to</i>
			suggested inference, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοὐναντίον μηδενὸς -κοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὰ πρὸς αὑτὰς ἑκάστη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Demon.</u>
					63
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				372
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.30
			</span></i>.</div>
